[Text: 早く僕の妹にならないかな～～]
[Text: I hope you become my little sister soon~~]

149
00:23:06,286 --> 00:23:10,866
[Text: ならないよ！！なんで白上のことそんなに妹にしたいの？]
[Text: Not happening!! Why do you want Shirakami as your little sister so badly?]

150
00:23:11,866 --> 00:23:17,486
[Text: え～？言われてみればなんでだろう？可愛いからでしょ？]
[Text: Eh~? Now that you mention it, I wonder why? Because you're cute, right?]

151
00:23:18,246 --> 00:23:21,426
[Text: うん、可愛いからでしょ？]
[Text: Yep, because you're cute, right?]

152
00:23:21,846 --> 00:23:25,466
[Text: 可愛いからばっかりじゃん！もう～～]
[Text: That's just because I'm cute! Jeez~~]

153
00:23:25,986 --> 00:23:30,386
[Text: え～～！お姉ちゃん分かんないな～～]
[Text: Eh~~! Big sis doesn't get it~~]

154
00:23:31,046 --> 00:23:36,886
[Text: まったく…お姉ちゃんは仕方ないなぁ……って、あ]
[Text: Good grief... Big sis really can't be helped... Wait, ah]

155
00:23:36,986 --> 00:23:41,146
[Text: フブにゃ～～～！！！❤❤❤]
[Text: Fubu-nya~~~~!!! ❤❤❤]

156
00:23:47,331 --> 00:23:58,491
My little sister, I love you, my little angel, very, very cute, my little sister, I love you, do you know what I mean?

157
00:23:58,491 --> 00:24:03,831
聞いて、聞いて、私お姉ちゃんだよ
Listen, listen, I'm the big sister!

158
