遊ぼ、遊ぼ、あなたまだ喋れないのね？
Let's play, let's play, you still can't talk yet, right?

159
00:24:10,471 --> 00:24:15,671
お下がり普通は嫌でしょ？むしろ喜んで着てる
Hand-me-downs are normally annoying, right? You're actually happy to wear them.

160
00:24:15,871 --> 00:24:21,411
完璧を演じなくっちゃ 理想のお姉ちゃんだもん
Gotta act all perfect, since I'm the ideal big sister!

161
00:24:21,591 --> 00:24:26,671
弱さを見せないこと 逆に弱点なんです
Not showing any weakness is actually a weakness in itself.

162
00:24:27,051 --> 00:24:31,931
平等にチャンスはあるから… 負けるな私！
Everyone has an equal chance... Don't lose, me!

163
00:24:32,351 --> 00:24:37,791
あなたの夢は右で、私の夢は左
Your dream is on the right, my dream is on the left.

164
00:24:38,111 --> 00:24:43,231
ゆらゆらと迷っても 諦めない性格よ
Even if I sway and hesitate, I'm the type who never gives up!

165
00:24:43,471 --> 00:24:49,251
泣きたい時は泣いて 笑いたい時は笑って
When you want to cry, cry; when you want to laugh, laugh!

166
00:24:49,651 --> 00:24:52,791
疲れたら休みましょ
When you're tired, let's take a break.

167
00:24:52,911 --> 00:24:55,891
困ったら相談乗るから
If you're in trouble, I'll hear you out.

168
00:24:56,171 --> 00:25:00,991
理由があるとすれば あなたは私の天使
If there's any reason, it's that you are my angel!

169
00:25:02,347 --> 00:25:07,067
My little angel, I love you せーの I love you
My little angel, I love you! Ready, I love you!

170
00:25:07,447 --> 00:25:09,727
My little sister, I love you せーの I love you
My little sister, I love you! Ready, I love you!

171
00:25:09,847 --> 00:25:12,127
Do you know what I mean?

172
00:25:13,087 --> 00:25:17,907
そっぽ向かれて 話しすらできない
Being given the cold shoulder, I can't even talk to you!

173
00:25:18,847 --> 00:25:23,547
心配しすぎ？ 話せないことだってある
Worrying too much? There are things I just can't say out loud.

174
00:25:23,867 --> 00:25:26,687
私は私でヤバイ
I've got my own problems, oh no!

175
00:25:26,947 --> 00:25:29,767
手抜きは絶対NG 完璧を演じなくっちゃ
No cutting corners ever, I've got to play it perfectly!

176
00:25:31,987 --> 00:25:35,747
理想のお姉ちゃんだもん レベル上げ得意な方で
Since I'm the ideal older sister, I'll put my best effort into leveling up!

177
00:25:38,727 --> 00:25:44,207
努力は惜しまない 神様は必ず見てるよ 頑張っちゃう
I won't spare any effort, God is always watching, so I'll do my best!

178
00:25:46,727 --> 00:25:52,127
作った笑顔じゃない あなたのホントが好き
This isn't a fake smile, I truly love the real you!

179
00:25:52,787 --> 00:25:57,747
イライラが溜まったら 甘いもの食べちゃおう
When frustration builds up, let's just eat something sweet!

180
00:25:58,487 --> 00:26:03,287
認めたくない時ほど認めて 悔しい時は眠って
Admit it even more when you'd rather not, and sleep when you feel frustrated!

181
00:26:03,787 --> 00:26:09,547
雨の日は羽根休み 濡れてたら拭いてあげるから
Rainy days are for resting your wings, if you're wet, I'll wipe you dry!

182
00:26:09,787 --> 00:26:15,607
理由があるとすれば あなたは私の...
If there has to be a reason... you are my...

183
00:26:16,307 --> 00:26:26,347
そんな表情するんだね 初めて見た 可愛いよ
You're making that kind of expression... It's the first time I've seen it, how cute!

184
00:26:27,567 --> 00:26:33,207
自慢だから 自信もって 見ておいでよ 世界を
It's something to be proud of, so be confident and behold the world!

185
00:26:39,467 --> 00:26:50,187
「あの子はいつも私の後ろをくっついて歩いていて いつの間にか1人で自分の夢に向かって突き進んでいて...えっと、みんなも応援してあげてください！」
That girl has always walked right behind me, and before I knew it, she started charging ahead toward her own dream all by herself... Um, everyone, please cheer her on too!

186
00:26:50,467 --> 00:26:52,907
My little angel, I love you せーの
My little angel, I love you! Ready...

187
00:26:53,067 --> 00:26:55,667
I love you

188
00:26:56,047 --> 00:26:58,467
My little angel, I love you せーの
My little angel, I love you! Ready...

189
00:26:58,607 --> 00:27:01,067
I love you

190
00:27:01,627 --> 00:27:06,807
陰口なんて気にしてる場合じゃないでしょ
This isn't the time to worry about gossip behind our backs!

191
00:27:07,127 --> 00:27:12,107
平等にチャンスはあるから... 負けるな私！
Everyone gets an equal chance, so I won't lose!

192
00:27:12,487 --> 00:27:17,907
あなたの描く夢 私の描く夢
The dream you envision, the dream I envision...

193
00:27:18,687 --> 00:27:23,907
叶えよう約束ね 小指を重ねよう
Let's make it come true, it's a promise, let's link our pinkies!

194
00:27:24,227 --> 00:27:29,467
あなたの夢は右で 私の夢は左
Your dream is on the right, my dream is on the left.

195
00:27:29,747 --> 00:27:34,867
ゆらゆらと迷っても どこかできっと繋がる
Even if we sway and wander, we'll surely connect somewhere.

196
00:27:35,227 --> 00:27:40,807
泣きたい時は泣いて 笑いたい時は笑って
Cry when you want to cry, laugh when you want to laugh.

197
00:27:41,167 --> 00:27:46,307
疲れたら休みましょ 困ったら相談乗るから
Rest when you're tired, I'll listen when you're troubled.

198
00:27:46,687 --> 00:27:52,667
理由があるとすれば あなたは私の天使
If there has to be a reason... you are my angel!

199
00:27:53,167 --> 00:27:55,667
My little sister, I love you

200
00:27:56,467 --> 00:27:58,907
My little angel tell tell girl
My little angel, tell-tell girl!

201
00:27:59,227 --> 00:28:03,367
My little sister, I love you Do you know what I mean?

202
00:28:16,987 --> 00:28:22,887
目指せよ快眠 勝ち取れ安眠 いざ夢の世界へ
Aim for good sleep, claim peaceful sleep, now heading to the world of dreams!

203
00:28:23,287 --> 00:28:29,087
理想の眠りを求めて さあ始めようおやすみ
In search of ideal sleep, come on, let's begin, goodnight!

204
00:28:29,972 --> 00:28:37,472
快眠！安眠！スヤリスト生活
Good sleep! Peaceful sleep! The sleepy list lifestyle!

205
00:28:37,987 --> 00:28:44,487
私は囚われの姫 魔王の城の中で
I am a captive princess inside the Demon Lord's castle.

206
00:28:44,887 --> 00:28:51,027
独り閉じ込められては 毎日ひたすらに眠ってます
Locked away all by myself, every single day I just sleep endlessly.

207
00:28:51,467 --> 00:28:57,747
今宵も布団に入り スヤスヤリスと生活
Tonight too, I get into my futon, living the sleepy-squirrely life!

208
00:28:58,067 --> 00:29:04,807
枕もシーツも 硬くて眠れない 君を寝具にしてやろうか
Both my pillow and sheets are too hard to sleep on... should I turn you into my bedding instead?

209
00:29:07,987 --> 00:29:13,927
目指せよ快眠 勝ち取れ安眠 いざ夢の世界へ
Aim for good sleep, claim peaceful sleep, now heading to the world of dreams!

210
00:29:14,327 --> 00:29:20,987
ふかふかの枕手に入れて この疲れ癒したい
Getting my hands on a fluffy pillow, I want to soothe this fatigue.

211
00:29:21,467 --> 00:29:27,767
恐れず前進 ほぐせよ全身 瞼を閉じたなら
Move forward without fear, loosen up your whole body, once you close your eyelids...

212
00:29:28,327 --> 00:29:31,847
すべすべのシーツの上で さあ始めようおやすみ
On top of smooth, silky sheets, come on, let's begin, goodnight!

213
00:29:34,972 --> 00:29:42,472
快眠！安眠！スヤリスト生活
Good sleep! Peaceful sleep! The sleepy list lifestyle!

214
00:29:42,827 --> 00:29:48,967
私は囚われの姫 悲鳴が響く夜に
I am a captive princess on a night when screams echo.

215
00:29:49,347 --> 00:29:55,667
独りで檻を抜け出し 今日もお散歩へと行ってきます
Slipping out of my cage all by myself, today too I'm heading out for a stroll.

216
00:29:56,047 --> 00:30:01,827
幾多の試練を越えて 新たな寝具の元へ
Overcoming numerous trials, towards brand-new bedding!

217
00:31:53,979 --> 00:31:59,919
う〜む このマスコット可愛いな…
Hmm... This mascot is so cute...

218
00:32:01,199 --> 00:32:07,099
へぇ 野球か… もしかしたら球場にいるかもだよ！行ってみる？
Huh, baseball... Maybe they're at the stadium! Want to go check it out?

219
00:32:08,019 --> 00:32:11,119
え！ 行ってみたい！行ってみたい！
Eh! I want to go! I want to go!

220
00:32:12,019 --> 00:32:15,619
チケットとってみるよ！何日空いてる？
I'll get tickets! What days are you free?

221
00:32:16,039 --> 00:32:19,379
み、みおちゃん… きゅん！
M-Mio-chan... Thump!

222
00:32:20,993 --> 00:32:22,093
[Title: 試合観戦中…]
[Title: Watching a game...]

223
00:32:23,839 --> 00:32:30,159
うわああみおちゃん！ここを押さえたら…勝てるってこと！？
Whoa-ah Mio-chan! If we hold them here... does that mean we win!?

224
00:32:31,079 --> 00:32:35,399
そうだよそうだよ！こんな熱い試合が見れるなんて…！
That's right, that's right! To be able to see such a heated game...!

225
00:32:36,019 --> 00:32:38,139
ってこれって…
Wait, this is...

226
00:32:38,999 --> 00:32:42,159
ホームランだよ！おかゆホームランだよ！
A home run! Okayu, it's a home run!

227
00:32:43,159 --> 00:32:48,359
す、すごい！野球すっげーーーっ！！！！
A-Amazing! Baseball is awesooome!!!!

228
00:33:04,320 --> 00:33:09,120
どこまでも続くような青の季節は
The blue season that felt like it would last forever

229
00:33:09,970 --> 00:33:15,900
四つ並ぶ眼の前を遮るものは何もない
Nothing blocks my view right before my eyes four abreast

230
00:33:16,350 --> 00:33:21,490
アスファルト 蝉時雨を反射して
Reflecting the cicada showers off the asphalt,

231
00:33:21,490 --> 00:33:27,020
きみという沈黙が聞こえなくなる
the silence that is you can no longer be heard

232
00:33:28,370 --> 00:33:34,480
この日々が色褪せる 僕と違うきみの匂いを知ってしまっても
Even if these days fade in color, even if I come to know your scent, so different from mine,

233
00:33:35,280 --> 00:33:40,250
置き忘れてきた永遠の底に
at the bottom of the eternity we left behind

234
00:33:41,950 --> 00:33:47,310
今でも青が棲んでいる 今でも青は澄んでいる
Blue dwells within even now, blue is clear even now

235
00:33:48,060 --> 00:33:53,640
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに 届かなかった
No matter how close any prayers or words got, they couldn't reach you

236
00:33:54,010 --> 00:34:01,880
まるで 静かな恋のような 頬を伝った夏のような色のなか きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる
Like a quiet romance, amidst the summer-like colors that streamed down my cheeks, words cursing you remain stuck deep in my throat

237
00:34:02,120 --> 00:34:07,450
「また会えるよね」って 声にならない声
A voice that couldn't form words, saying, "We'll meet again, right?"

238
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:26,930
昼下がり じめつく風の季節は
The muggy afternoon breeze of the season

239
00:34:27,680 --> 00:34:33,060
想い馳せる まだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
turns thoughts to our portraits when we were still nobodies

240
00:34:33,830 --> 00:34:38,870
何もかも分かち合えたはずだった
We surely should have shared and understood everything

241
00:34:39,330 --> 00:34:46,200
あの日から少しずつ きみと違う僕という呪いが肥っていく
From that day on, little by little, the curse of being me, so different from you, grows heavier

242
00:35:04,158 --> 00:35:10,518
見落としたこと 悔やみ尽くして
Regretting to exhaustion that I overlooked it...

243
00:35:18,158 --> 00:35:22,738
徒花と咲いて 散っていく君に
To you who bloomed like a fruitless flower and scattered away,

244
00:35:23,068 --> 00:35:23,858
さようなら
Farewell.

245
00:35:26,048 --> 00:35:31,628
今でも青が棲んでいる 今でも青は澄んでいる
Even now, blue resides within. Even now, blue is clear and pure.

246
00:35:32,308 --> 00:35:38,048
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに 届かなかった
No matter what prayer or words I used, even as I got close, they couldn't reach.

247
00:35:38,868 --> 00:35:44,518
まるで 静かな恋のような 頬を伝った夏のような色のなか
Like a quiet love, in the color like summer running down my cheek,

248
00:35:45,618 --> 00:35:53,358
君を呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる 「また会えるよね」って
the words cursing you are still stuck deep in my throat... Saying "We'll meet again, right?"

249
00:35:54,338 --> 00:35:56,688
声にならない声
a voice that cannot become a voice.

250
00:35:57,948 --> 00:36:03,848
無限に膨張する銀河の星の粒のように 指の隙間を零れた
Spilling through the gaps between my fingers like grains of stars in an infinitely expanding galaxy,

251
00:36:15,930 --> 00:36:20,510
すっかり野球一人でも見に来るようになってしまったな…
[Text: I've really gotten used to coming to watch baseball games all by myself...]

252
00:36:21,510 --> 00:36:26,490
ご飯並んでるうちにスターティングメンバー発表されたぞ…ってえっ？
[Text: While I was lining up for food, the starting lineup was announced... Wait, huh?]

253
00:36:28,530 --> 00:36:30,340
…ってえ？スターマン？
[Text: ...Huh? Starman?]

254
00:36:31,090 --> 00:36:32,420
［手招きする動作］
[Text: (Motioning to follow)]

255
00:36:33,970 --> 00:36:35,690
え？ええっ？
[Text: Eh? Eeeh?!]

256
00:36:35,810 --> 00:36:39,770
スターマンがこっそり僕についてこいって言ってる…
[Text: Starman is secretly telling me to follow him...]

257
00:36:41,130 --> 00:36:43,270
どういうことーーーーッ！？！？！？！
[Text: What is the meaning of thisーーーーッ！？！？！？!]

258
